    {
      "t": "Problem",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Referral signups were declining; analysis of user behaviour showed monetary rewards alone weren't motivating students to share.",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Approach & key decisions",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Proposed collaborative prep materials as an incentive and ran a three-arm A/B test: monetary vs prep-material vs combined. The trade-off was explicit: removing money risked immediate referrals (the monetary-only cohort dropped ~10%), but the combined arm lifted overall referral signups 15% while holding acquisition cost within target, balancing short-term incentive seekers against long-term engagement.",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Iterations",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Mixpanel funnel analysis exposed a drop-off at the copy-link step; highlighting the link and decluttering the dashboard lifted copy interactions 18% and referral conversions 10%. Survey feedback showed milestone gadgets felt irrelevant; pivoting the sixth-referral reward to a ChatGPT Plus voucher lifted power-user referrals 20%. CleverTap re-engagement journeys (WhatsApp, email, SMS) reactivated dormant users for +12% signups and ~5% referral-driven revenue lift that quarter.",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Learnings",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Declined a post-exam prep-material proposal after quantifying that the referral pipeline's revenue impact was larger — protected the highest-impact initiative.",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Results",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Referral-to-signup conversion rose from 7% to 12%; referrals became a core growth lever.",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "t": "Specific internal data is summarised at the level Newton School permits publicly; happy to discuss details in conversation.",
      "hidden": false,
      "visible": true
    },
